{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1157.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"84fc4ff0300bda11704008a2401aeae6792c3807b7eb847012d6055ccb312095","ja":"茜ちゃんになろう！","zh":"成为小茜吧！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1157.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"5c7650a89d1d4aa9f5f8e49e6e1395fe9ff6933f7db44f0432a256fa06f38be8","ja":"ええっ！　茜ちゃんになるって……。\nそれってどういうこと！？","zh":"诶诶！　说是要变成小茜……\n那到底是怎么回事啊！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1157.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"79a82dfdce4c996d60a86f7604cace48709a3c4b5cc1cc53b18f2108c81e333b","ja":"茜ちゃんの、プリティーな喋り方をマネするんだよ！\nきっとネコちゃんのハートもわしづかみだよ！","zh":"模仿小茜可爱的说话方式吧！\n猫咪的心肯定也会被紧紧抓住的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1157.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"fe84503c750aee2b9e2cc9fc12ef627080993b6a04c770187c13e311f4c898e2","ja":"ネコちゃん、茜ちゃんだニャ～♪\nニャニャ！","zh":"小猫咪，是小茜喵～♪\n喵喵！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1157.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"00b4c5581e0795d917016ef95deff118f34cdabdf3950bed8d5f4337e3c95ca4","ja":"えへへっ、面白そう！　えっと……\n育ちゃんだニャ～♪　ニャニャ！","zh":"嘿嘿，好像很有意思！那个……\n我是小育喵～♪　喵喵！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1157.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"e8e928159be40e7de9e40f967f2c66fc3c70636073ebb0e19666d655ceb04b69","ja":"うんうん、いい感じだよ！\nほらほら、かおりんもやってみて！","zh":"嗯嗯，感觉很不错哦！\n快点快点，歌织也来试试看吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1157.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"9163977d8ba89f3f289b7a1388b417702062e06de6884d5c01236df93eb7c82d","ja":"えっ！　ええっと……\nか、歌織ちゃん……だ、ニャ……。","zh":"诶！　那个……\n歌、歌织……喵……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1157.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"4292f3cf10d99aa905b6fc67252b401c52315e56aebc1114cf2242309439684e","ja":"そんなんじゃ茜ちゃんにはなれないよ！\nほら、もっとニャニャンとして！","zh":"那样可当不了小茜哦！\n来，再多表现出一点喵喵的感觉！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1157.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"848434bbf90ff044950a7a9d048ebf2e639f3682a517d32cef2839ea6ace322e","ja":"ええっ！？\nえっと……歌織ちゃん……だ、に、ニャ…ううっ！","zh":"咦咦！？\n那个……歌织……喵……呜呜！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1157.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"303ac7cb8c812be05ebc1a2355a942b6f7c797f58a16fef7ccfdde4673120db5","ja":"歌織さん、恥ずかしがっちゃダメだよ！\nもっと茜ちゃんになりきらなきゃ！","zh":"歌织小姐，可不能害羞哦！\n必须更加彻底融入小茜的角色才行！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1157.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"8bc241ee3c612bf72c5e05ed49ef6285159b93bb2e99f7993ebca7f7cea584dd","ja":"育ちゃんまで……。\nわ、わかったわ。頑張ってみるわね……。","zh":"连小育也这么说……。\n我、我知道了。我会努力试试看的……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1157.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"2cf299b9db82240fc03c5e3aeca137dae387b6b9aadfc396c17215c632e680b3","ja":"数十分後……","zh":"数十分钟后……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1157.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"30ee4567a9f2c274a54b0dd73b8a1725438c97191d737fc8baeba27eeaf213b5","ja":"……つ、次こそ！\n歌織ちゃんだニャ～～～！　ニャニャ～～～～！","zh":"……下、下次一定！\n是歌织喵～～～！　喵喵～～～～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1157.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"e58f6e96a0de49237ddd450723f226a346497f0ca2af2c89e7aee044b3d25bbd","ja":"「ニャーニャー！」「ニャーニャー♪」","zh":"「喵喵！」「喵喵♪」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1157.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"5a0a1eba54132d12a5c8cdf931d54181cf479f4c336cbdab7df56bde612cdf4c","ja":"あっ！　みんなが戻ってきたよ！","zh":"啊！大家回来了哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1157.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"d7d8a4441c718dfb57e0cb52e8a36df422ec3f353ac9e708989a8636b4ce4a4e","ja":"ふふっ、これでかおりんも茜ちゃんマスター……。\nネコちゃんに愛されること間違いなしだね！","zh":"呵呵，这样一来歌织也是小茜大师了……\n肯定会深受猫咪喜爱的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1157.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"a169af4435bd9b7babc1220a028f980f4d4da33d7c6a92eab82b9029d891867c","ja":"えーっと……そ、そうね！\nさすが茜ちゃんだわ！","zh":"那个……没、没错！\n真不愧是小茜！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1157.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"3b6f536fbbbff04e9124d5ed585692fef1fc1875f29139176435ee4e93d3aca6","ja":"（私たちがずっとここにいたから、\nみんなが慣れただけな気もするけど……）","zh":"（不过感觉也只是因为我们一直待在这里，\n大家习惯了而已……）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
